Game Boy : les flÃ¨ches et les touches physiques Z/X commandent la croix et A/B. EntrÃ©e = Start, Retour arriÃ¨re = Select. Ã‰chap quitte et sauvegarde lâ€™Ã©tat. Le bouton disquette sauvegarde sans quitter ; la flÃ¨che circulaire recommence la partie. Les fichiers .gb ouvrent Game Boy, les .gbc ouvrent Game Boy Color. Les sauvegardes et Ã©tats sont dans /Saves/GB ou /Saves/GBC. Le dernier Ã©tat compatible est repris Ã  la prochaine ouverture de la ROM.␀␀␀Create a theme: select a color from the list or touch an object in the preview. Adjust R, G and B, or enter #RRGGBB, then save.

In Files, select a file and choose Open with... to pick a program from Applications. The launcher includes file and folder pickers, recent items and favorites. Run starts the program; Ctrl+. stops it.

Game Boy and Game Boy Color: arrows control the D-pad; Z and X are A and B; Enter is Start; Backspace is Select. Escape exits and saves. The disk button saves without exiting; the circular arrow restarts. Open .gb or .gbc ROM files from Files. Saves and states are kept under /Saves/GB and /Saves/GBC. The latest compatible state resumes when the ROM is reopened.␀␀CrÃ©er un thÃ¨me : choisissez une couleur dans la liste ou en touchant un objet de lâ€™aperÃ§u. RÃ©glez R, G et B, ou saisissez #RRGGBB, puis enregistrez.

Dans Fichiers, sÃ©lectionnez un fichier puis Ouvrir avecâ€¦ et choisissez un .app.elf dans Applications. Le lanceur propose aussi un sÃ©lecteur de fichiers et de dossiers, les rÃ©cents et les favoris. ExÃ©cuter lance le programme ; Ctrl+. demande son arrÃªt.

Game Boy : les flÃ¨ches et les touches physiques Z/X commandent la croix et A/B. EntrÃ©e = Start, Retour arriÃ¨re = Select. Ã‰chap quitte et sauvegarde lâ€™Ã©tat. Le bouton disquette sauvegarde sans quitter ; la flÃ¨che circulaire recommence la partie. Les sauvegardes et Ã©tats sont dans /Saves/GB. Le dernier Ã©tat compatible est repris Ã  la prochaine ouverture de la ROM.␀Create a theme is a native tool: select a color from the list or by touching a preview object. Adjust R, G and B, or enter #RRGGBB, then save. Its widgets and buffers are released when you close it.

In Files, select a file, choose Open with... and select an .app.elf from Applications. The launcher also offers file and folder pickers, recent items and favorites. Run starts the program; Ctrl+. requests a stop.

Game Boy: arrow keys and the physical Z/X keys control the D-pad and A/B. Enter = Start, Backspace = Select. Escape exits and saves state. The disk button saves without exiting; the circular arrow restarts the game. Saves and states are in /Saves/GB. The latest compatible state resumes when you reopen the ROM.␀␀␀CrÃ©er un thÃ¨me : choisissez une couleur dans la liste ou en touchant un objet de lâ€™aperÃ§u. RÃ©glez R, G et B, ou saisissez #RRGGBB, puis enregistrez. Le curseur Noir / Blanc assombrit ou Ã©claircit la couleur de maniÃ¨re symÃ©trique ; au centre, il conserve la couleur de dÃ©part.

Dans Explorateur, sÃ©lectionnez un fichier puis Ouvrir avecâ€¦ et choisissez une application ELF compatible. Le lanceur propose aussi un sÃ©lecteur de fichiers et de dossiers, les rÃ©cents et les favoris. ExÃ©cuter lance le programme ; Ctrl+. demande son arrÃªt.

Game Boy : les flÃ¨ches et les touches physiques Z/X commandent la croix et A/B. EntrÃ©e = Start, Retour arriÃ¨re = Select. Ã‰chap quitte et sauvegarde lâ€™Ã©tat. Le bouton disquette sauvegarde sans quitter ; la flÃ¨che circulaire recommence la partie. Les fichiers .gb ouvrent Game Boy, les .gbc ouvrent Game Boy Color. Les sauvegardes et Ã©tats sont dans /Saves/GB ou /Saves/GBC. Le dernier Ã©tat compatible est repris Ã  la prochaine ouverture de la ROM.␀␀␀␀Create a theme: choose a colour from the list or by touching an object in the preview. Adjust R, G and B or enter #RRGGBB, then save. The Black / White slider darkens or lightens the colour symmetrically; at the centre it preserves the starting colour.

In Explorer, select a file, then Open with... and choose a compatible ELF application. The launcher also offers a file and folder picker, recent items and favourites. Run starts the program; Ctrl+. requests it to stop.

Game Boy: arrow keys and physical Z/X keys control the directional pad and A/B. Enter = Start, Backspace = Select. Escape exits and saves the state. The floppy-disk button saves without exiting; the circular arrow restarts the game. .gb files open Game Boy; .gbc files open Game Boy Color. Saves and states are in /Saves/GB or /Saves/GBC. The last compatible state resumes when the ROM is next opened.␀Create a theme: choose a colour from the list or by touching an object in the preview. Adjust R, G and B or enter #RRGGBB, then save. The Black / White slider darkens or lightens the colour symmetrically; at the centre it preserves the starting colour.

In Explorer, select a file, then Open with... and choose a compatible ELF application. The launcher also offers a file and folder picker, recent items and favourites. Run starts the program; Ctrl+. requests it to stop.

Game Boy: arrow keys and physical Z/X keys control the directional pad and A/B. Enter = Start, Backspace = Select. Escape exits and saves the state. The floppy-disk button saves without exiting; the circular arrow restarts the game. .gb files open Game Boy; .gbc files open Game Boy Color. Saves and states are in /Saves/GB or /Saves/GBC. The last compatible state resumes when the ROM is next opened.

A USB HID or XInput controller also operates the OS: directional pad to navigate, A to confirm, B to go back. In MicroPython, the gamepad.py module provides state(). capture(True) reserves input for the script while its interface is in the foreground; capture(False) restores OS navigation.␀CrÃ©er une sous-catÃ©gorie␀␀Create a subcategory␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Enter␀␀Ctrl+Maj+C␀␀Ctrl+Shift+C␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Maj+H␀␀Ctrl+Maj+I␀␀Ctrl+Shift+I␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Maj+L␀␀Ctrl+Shift+L␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Maj+N␀␀Ctrl+Shift+N␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Maj+O␀␀Ctrl+Shift+O␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Maj+R␀␀Ctrl+Shift+R␀␀␀␀Ctrl+Shift+S␀␀␀␀Ctrl+T inserts a table or opens the selected table. Touch a cell or use Tab / Shift+Tab to choose one; Enter starts editing. Cells support bold, italic, headings, text colour and highlighting. Apply commits the whole table; closing without applying discards the dialog changes.

Ctrl+Shift+I imports a JPEG, PNG or BMP image from SD. Save the document first. A copy goes into its .assets folder. Keep that folder with the document when moving it. Selecting an image and pressing Delete removes it from the text without deleting its file.

Ctrl+Shift+C opens colours: the first row controls text, the second its background. The automatic swatch uses the theme colours.

Files remain UTF-8 Markdown: GFM tables, Markdown images and HTML span/CSS colours. Some readers filter these styles. Unsupported complex constructs may remain literal. Undo / Redo can reverse an applied edit.

The active cell keeps a subtle theme tint and a thin accent border. It remains marked while using format buttons or closing the keyboard. Tab and arrow keys move the selection; Enter starts editing.␀␀Curseur␀Cursor␀␀Câˆ’␀␀␀␀C-␀␀D - Test Ã©cran OS : services en pause. Touchez pour quitter.␀␀␀D - OS screen test: foreground services paused. Touch to exit.␀␀D Â· Ã‰cran OS␀␀D - OS screen␀␀␀DIRECT  â€¢  %02lu:%02lu␀␀␀␀LIVE  *  %02lu:%02lu␀␀␀␀Checkerboard␀␀␀␀Danois␀␀Danish␀␀Dans Explorateur, Haut/Bas choisissent un Ã©lÃ©ment et EntrÃ©e ouvre le fichier ou le dossier. Retour arriÃ¨re remonte au dossier parent. Au tactile, touchez pour sÃ©lectionner ; touchez Ã  nouveau lâ€™Ã©lÃ©ment sÃ©lectionnÃ© pour lâ€™ouvrir, sans contrainte de dÃ©lai. Copier / Couper prÃ©pare lâ€™Ã©lÃ©ment ; Coller agit dans le dossier courant.

