La loupe ou Ctrl+F cherche les noms de fichiers et dossiers dans le dossier courant et tous ses sous-dossiers. La casse et les accents latins sont ignorÃ©s ; plusieurs mots doivent tous Ãªtre prÃ©sents. Les rÃ©sultats apparaissent progressivement, avec leur dossier. Une recherche partielle est signalÃ©e : affinez les mots si nÃ©cessaire. La croix apparaÃ®t seulement pendant une recherche et retire le filtre. Les textes et les sources, dont les scripts .py, sâ€™ouvrent dans Ã‰criture, sans exÃ©cution automatique.

Un fichier .bin ouvre la page Firmware. VÃ©rifier contrÃ´le la cible ESP32-P4, sa rÃ©vision, la taille et lâ€™empreinte. Installer Ã©crit dans la partition inactive et valide lâ€™image avant de changer le prochain dÃ©marrage. RedÃ©marrer lâ€™active. Utiliser un binaire application prÃ©vu pour ce Tab5, sans bootloader ni table de partitions. Garder une alimentation stable.␀In Explorer, Up/Down selects an item and Enter opens the file or folder. Backspace goes to the parent folder. With touch, tap to select, then tap the selected item again to open it, with no time limit. Copy / Cut prepares the item; Paste acts in the current folder.

System files remain accessible for updating data. Amber colouring indicates their role; hidden items are dimmed. Changing or deleting a configuration, language, font or catalogue can affect Tab5OS: keep a copy before making your own changes.

Save stores the document; Save as chooses its name and folder. Explorer updates after changes; F5 refreshes it, Ctrl+H shows hidden items, and Hide changes the selection's hidden state without renaming files. Previews count all visible items; previous backups remain in .Tab5Backups. Keep the storage connected while writing.

File names and document text are personal data: changing the interface language does not translate them.

The magnifying glass or Ctrl+F searches file and folder names in the current folder and all its subfolders. Case and Latin accents are ignored; all search words must be present. Results appear progressively with their folder. Partial searches are indicated: refine the words if necessary. The cross appears only during a search and removes the filter. Text and source files, including .py scripts, open in Writing without running automatically.

A .bin file opens the Firmware page. Verify checks the ESP32-P4 target, revision, size and fingerprint. Install writes to the inactive partition and validates the image before changing the next boot target. Restart activates it. Use an application binary made for this Tab5, without a bootloader or partition table. Keep the power supply stable.␀␀Dans Explorateur, Haut/Bas choisissent un Ã©lÃ©ment et EntrÃ©e ouvre le fichier ou le dossier. Retour arriÃ¨re remonte au dossier parent. Au tactile, touchez pour sÃ©lectionner ; touchez Ã  nouveau lâ€™Ã©lÃ©ment sÃ©lectionnÃ© pour lâ€™ouvrir, sans contrainte de dÃ©lai. Copier / Couper prÃ©pare lâ€™Ã©lÃ©ment ; Coller agit dans le dossier courant.

