 Wi-Fi network. Selecting a result uses its advertised port and queue path. An unadvertised printer can still be reached by entering its exact address. Enter or the on-screen keyboard's down arrow closes the keyboard. Check queries the printer without printing.

HTTP 426 requests a protocol upgrade, often TLS. Search may provide the IPPS address; Try IPPS tests a secure connection to the same host and port without sending a document. The certificate can be validated using /System/printer-ca.pem. Otherwise, compare the SHA-256 fingerprint with the printer's before trusting it. It is checked on every connection; a change blocks sending.

Choose A4, Letter or A5, orientation, resolution and a size from 25 to 200 %. At 100 %, photos and maps fit the printable area; enlargements may span several sheets. For text, the percentage changes font size and pagination. Pages are estimated before sending; a resolution adjusted to the printer may change rounding. Markdown images are separated from text; tables print as text. The printer must accept IPP and sRGB color PWG Raster. USB printing is unavailable. Cancelling during sending may leave a job in the printer queue: check before resending.

Calculator: digits, + - * /, parentheses, powers and 2 work on the physical keyboard. Enter or = calculates; Backspace corrects. MS stores the result, MR inserts MEM, M+/M- accumulate it, MC clears it. Degree/radian trigonometry, pi, ANS and unit conversions are available.

If HTTP 426 advertises Upgrade: TLS, verification now negotiates OPTIONS then TLS on the same HTTP connection. The advertised IPP address can therefore still be correct. Certificates are verified before sending any document. The engine must negotiate a compatible TLS version; a printer restricted to legacy TLS 1.0 can still fail. Print jobs are never resent automatically after an error.

The printer list and last selected address are saved in the Tab5, including across restarts. Only Search runs discovery again. A successful scan replaces the list; a network error retains the previous one. A manually entered address is saved after checking, printing or closing.

The printer button in the Editor toolbar saves the document and opens Print, just like Ctrl+P. If HTTP-to-TLS upgrade fails, diagnostics now show the printer's HTTP response; a positive socket number is no longer presented as a cryptographic error.␀␀␀File -> Open on right adds a text to the reference collection. Click the path in either pane to choose a heading. In the right path popup, the list at the top also lets you switch documents. It is for reading; open a file on the left to edit it.

Each pane has its own passage and heading arrows. The path beside the filename shows your position. The outline marks the active heading. Another upward swipe after reaching the bottom opens the next passage.

A link [profile](Notes.md#characters) reaches a heading on the right. Wikilinks [[Characters]], [[Notes#Characters]] and [[Characters|the profile]] search the collection. Multiple results offer a choice. Wikilinks are a convention, not universal Markdown syntax.

Documents are displayed in passages. The index may still be building after opening. A selection cannot cross a passage change. Reload the right pane after saving changes to its source.␀␀␀Files␀␀␀Fichiers disponibles dans /USB␀␀Files available under /USB␀␀Files and branch updated␀␀␀␀Fichiers et dossiers␀␀␀␀Files and folders␀␀␀Files and saving␀␀␀␀Fichiers identiques.␀␀␀␀Files are identical.␀␀␀␀Modified files␀␀Fichiers, Ã©criture, lecture et rÃ©glages.␀␀Files, writing, reading and settings.␀␀␀Filtrer les mÃ©dias␀Filter media␀␀␀␀Filtrer par carte ou catÃ©gorie (plus de 256 bibliothÃ¨ques)␀␀␀␀Filter by board or category (more than 256 libraries)␀␀␀Filtres par cible dÃ©clarÃ©e et usage. Le catalogue reste disponible hors ligne.␀␀␀␀Filter by declared target and use. The catalogue remains available offline.␀Fin␀Fin (kHz)␀␀␀End (kHz)␀␀␀Fin de la vidÃ©o␀␀␀␀End of video␀␀␀␀Fin de ligne␀␀␀␀Line ending␀End of album␀␀␀␀End of recording␀␀␀␀Fin de rÃ©pertoire ZIP introuvable␀␀ZIP end-of-directory record not found␀␀␀Finishing move...␀␀␀Finalisation du transfert impossible.␀␀␀Cannot finalize the transfer.␀␀␀Finlande Â· GMT+2/+3␀␀␀␀Finland - GMT+2/+3␀␀Finnois␀Finnish␀Firmware␀␀␀␀Firmware incompatible with this Tab5 revision␀␀␀Firmware installed - restart to activate␀␀␀␀Firmware Â· partition flash␀Firmware - flash partition␀␀Fixer␀␀␀Hold␀␀␀␀Flux HTTP(S)␀␀␀␀HTTP(S) stream␀␀Flux MJPEG␀␀MJPEG stream␀␀␀␀Flux MJPEG en attenteâ€¦␀␀␀␀Waiting for MJPEG stream...␀Flux MP3/AAC indisponible␀␀␀MP3/AAC stream unavailable␀␀MP3/AAC stream unavailable - touch to retry␀Stream interrupted - retry scheduled␀␀␀␀Flux multipart sans taille de trame␀Multipart stream missing frame size␀Flux radio inaccessible␀Radio stream unavailable␀␀␀␀Radio stream unavailable - touch to retry␀␀␀FlÃ¨ches / Page : changer de page
