rigin URL rÃ¨gle la source. config user.name|user.email|tab5.credentialFile [valeur]. -C dossier change le projet pour cette commande. Les identifiants se lisent depuis un fichier ; aucun jeton dans la commande.␀Git: init folder; status; add -A or add -- file; commit -m message; log -n count; diff [--cached]. clone [--depth count] [--credential-file file] URL folder imports over HTTPS. fetch [remote], pull --ff-only [remote], push [remote]. remote set-url origin URL sets the source. config user.name|user.email|tab5.credentialFile [value]. -C folder selects a project for this command. Credentials are read from a file; never put a token in the command.␀␀Git : init dossier ; status ; add -A ou add -- fichier ; commit -m message ; log -n nombre ; diff [--cached]. clone [--depth nombre] [--credential-file fichier] URL dossier importe par HTTPS. fetch [remote], pull --ff-only [remote], push [remote]. remote set-url origin URL rÃ¨gle la source. config user.name|user.email|tab5.credentialFile|tab5.usernameSecret|tab5.tokenSecret [valeur]. -C dossier change le projet pour cette commande. Les rÃ©fÃ©rences usernameSecret et tokenSecret lisent le coffre dÃ©verrouillÃ© lors de lâ€™authentification. clone accepte --username-secret NOM --token-secret NOM. Le fichier dâ€™identification reste compatible. config --unset CLE retire une rÃ©fÃ©rence.␀Git: init folder; status; add -A or add -- file; commit -m message; log -n count; diff [--cached]. clone [--depth count] [--credential-file file] URL folder imports over HTTPS. fetch [remote], pull --ff-only [remote], push [remote]. remote set-url origin URL sets the source. config user.name|user.email|tab5.credentialFile|tab5.usernameSecret|tab5.tokenSecret [value]. -C folder selects a project for this command. The usernameSecret and tokenSecret references read the unlocked vault during authentication. clone accepts --username-secret NAME --token-secret NAME. Credential files remain supported. config --unset KEY removes a reference.␀␀␀Git 