Relief shades existing colours without changing their transparency. It simulates a surface, without creating 3D geometry. On a disc, Linear gives a conical profile and Circular a rounded profile; on other shapes they follow the boundary. Extrusion gives a constant height.

Profile width is set in pixels or as a proportion of the maximum distance to the boundary: at 100 %, it reaches the points furthest from the edge. Lower values leave a plateau. This setting does not apply to Extrusion.

Positive height: raised; negative: recessed. The light azimuth turns through 360 deg: 0 deg right, 90 deg down, 180 deg left, 270 deg up. Intensity controls lighting contrast; zero preserves the colours.␀␀La rÃ©paration conserve les fichiers existants. Elle ne rÃ©cupÃ¨re pas les fichiers supprimÃ©s.␀Repair preserves existing files. It does not recover deleted files.␀La rÃ©solution dÃ©pend du papier, de lâ€™imprimante et de lâ€™image source.␀Resolution depends on paper, printer and source image.␀␀The alarm sound stops after five minutes.␀␀␀Source changed: original preserved␀␀La source a changÃ© pendant la copie␀␀␀␀Source changed during copying␀␀␀La source ne fournit pas tous les zooms choisis␀This source does not provide every selected zoom level␀␀La taille reÃ§ue ne correspond pas Ã  cette Ã©dition. Actualisez le catalogue.␀␀The received size does not match this edition. Refresh the catalogue.␀␀␀Transform applies to the active layer selection, or to the whole image if nothing is selected.␀␀Deep sleep restarts the tablet before the alarm. Keep a charged battery or external power connected. Battery charging stops during this sleep mode.␀La vÃ©rification de lâ€™archive a Ã©chouÃ©. Recommencez son tÃ©lÃ©chargement.␀␀␀Archive verification failed. Restart its download.␀␀Lancement des applications indisponible␀Native application launching unavailable␀␀␀␀Lancement enregistrÃ©␀␀␀Launch settings saved␀␀␀Langage du document␀Document language␀␀␀Langage du documentâ€¦␀␀Document language...␀␀␀␀Langue␀␀Language␀␀␀␀Langue & fichiers␀␀␀Language & files␀␀␀␀Langue WikipÃ©dia (en, fr, de, esâ€¦)␀␀␀Wikipedia language (en, fr, de, es...)␀␀Langue de WikipÃ©dia␀␀␀␀Langue de lâ€™archive ZIM␀␀␀ZIM archive language␀␀␀␀Langue de lâ€™encyclopÃ©die Ã  tÃ©lÃ©charger␀␀␀␀Language of the encyclopedia to download␀␀␀␀Langue enregistrÃ©e â€” redÃ©marrez pour tout appliquer␀Language saved - restart to apply it everywhere␀Langue invalide␀Invalid language file␀␀␀Langue, clavier et fichiers␀Language, keybo