Pour signaler un problÃ¨me, relevez la version, les applications utilisÃ©es, la taille des fichiers, les opÃ©rations prÃ©cÃ©dentes et le message affichÃ©.␀The screen timeout dims then turns off the backlight. The tablet and any radio keep running, so this display sleep still uses battery power. A key or touch wakes the screen. To turn the tablet off, use its power button as described by M5Stack.

On Tab5, USB charging requires the tablet to be powered on and initialized. Turning off the screen does not turn off the tablet. The percentage alone cannot diagnose a battery; also check voltage, current and charge status. Without a battery, leave Battery installed off in Settings -> System -> Energy: the indicator stays USB, with no percentage or charging bolt. Enable it after installing a pack with the device powered off. This setting only controls the display, not the charger.

Settings -> System shows memory resources. The readout is passive: no automatic cache purge or periodic notification changes the screen. The last reset cause and serial logs help distinguish a memory error, a lockup and a voltage drop.

To report a problem, note the version, apps used, file sizes, preceding actions and the displayed message.␀The screen timeout dims then turns off the backlight. The tablet and any radio keep running, so this display sleep still uses battery power. A key or touch wakes the screen. To turn the tablet off, use its power button as described by M5Stack.

