Settings -> System shows memory resources. The readout is passive: no automatic cache purge or periodic notification changes the screen. The last reset cause and serial logs help distinguish a memory error, a lockup and a voltage drop.

To report a problem, note the version, apps used, file sizes, preceding actions and the displayed message.

Battery monitoring uses pack voltage and current, not the percentage. A persistently low battery triggers a warning; a critical voltage starts a countdown followed by power-off. Plug in the tablet and save your work. Detected charging or an invalid reading cancels the countdown. This software protection does not guarantee recovery of a pack whose protection has already tripped. Charging requires the tablet to be powered on and initialized.␀␀␀␀This Git repository contains conflicts.␀This Git repository requires resolution on a computer.␀␀The file changed: verify it again␀␀␀The file changed. Refresh before trying again.␀␀Le fichier existe dÃ©jÃ . Choisissez un autre nom ou ajoutez --overwrite.␀␀␀The file already exists. Choose another name or add --overwrite.␀␀␀␀Le fichier existe dÃ©jÃ . Choisissez un autre nom.␀␀The file already exists. Choose a different name.␀␀␀Le fichier original reste lisible. Seule la copie .t5v est protÃ©gÃ©e par le mot de passe.␀␀The original remains readable. Only the .t5v copy is password-protected.␀␀␀␀Le fichier sur la carte SD sera conservÃ©.␀␀The file on the SD card will be kept.␀␀␀Le formatage commence uniquement aprÃ¨s confirmation.␀␀␀Formatting starts only after confirmation.␀␀Le langage choisi rÃ¨gle uniquement la coloration de ce document.␀␀␀The selected language only controls highlighting in this document.␀␀Le miroir a changÃ© sa copie. RÃ©essayez pour utiliser un autre miroir.␀The mirror changed its copy. Retry to use another mirror.␀␀␀Le nom USB est dÃ©jÃ  utilisÃ© sur la microSD␀␀␀The name USB is already used on the microSD␀Le nom doit contenir au moins une lettre ou un chiffre ASCII␀␀␀␀The name must contain at least one ASCII letter or digit␀␀␀␀Le paquet existe dÃ©jÃ ␀The package already exists␀␀Le remplacement global est annulable en une fois ; il peut Ãªtre refusÃ© si lâ€™historique manque de place.␀Replace all can be undone in one step; it may fail if undo history has insufficient space.␀␀Le salon doit commencer par # ou &␀␀C