Exemples : cd /Documents ; ls -l ; cat "notes.md" ; cp "notes.md" "copie.md". Les boucles sâ€™Ã©crivent : for f in *.md; do wc "$f"; done. Les variables, guillemets, redirections > et >>, et conditions && et || sont disponibles.

Tubes : commande | filtre. Substitutions : $(commande) ou `commande`. Sans fichier, cat/head/tail/grep/wc lisent le tube ; < lit un fichier.

Limites : 16 commandes par tube, 256 Kio entre commandes ; substitutions : 4 niveaux et 8 Kio. Les commandes du tube sont exÃ©cutÃ©es successivement ; le statut est celui de la derniÃ¨re.

Les guillemets doubles conservent les espaces des substitutions ; les apostrophes les dÃ©sactivent. Les tÃ¢ches en arriÃ¨re-plan & ne sont pas disponibles.

Les commandes dns, ping, tcp, ports, headers, wget et curl permettent de consulter le rÃ©seau et de tÃ©lÃ©charger sur SD ou USB ; help suivi du nom dÃ©taille les paramÃ¨tres et donne un exemple. Lâ€™application Pentest propose sÃ©parÃ©ment des analyses DNS, ICMP, TCP et HTTP/TLS avec un rapport enregistrable.␀␀␀The terminal also works while a Python application is running. Enter runs a command. help lists commands; help cp or cp --help explains arguments. Up/Down recalls history; Tab completes commands and paths.

Ctrl+A/C/X/V/Z/Y and the editing icons act on the active field; output can be selected and remains read-only. Ctrl+C copies the selection or interrupts the command if nothing is selected; closing the terminal also interrupts the work.

Examples: cd /Documents; ls -l; cat "notes.md"; cp "notes.md" "copy.md". Loops: for f in *.md; do wc "$f"; done. Variables, quotes, > and >> redirection, && and || conditions are available.

Pipes: command | filter. Substitutions: $(command) or `command`. Without a file, cat/head/tail/grep/wc read from the pipe; < reads a file.

Limits: 16 commands per pipeline, 256 KiB between commands; substitutions: 4 levels and 8 KiB. Pipeline commands run sequentially; the status is that of the last command.

Double quotes preserve spaces in substitutions; single quotes disable substitutions. Background jobs with & are unavailable.

The dns, ping, tcp, ports, headers, wget and curl commands inspect the network and download to SD or USB; help followed by the command name explains parameters and gives an example. The separate Pentest app offers DNS, ICMP, TCP and HTTP/TLS analysis with a report you can save.␀␀The terminal also works while a Python application is running. Enter runs a command. help lists commands; help cp or cp --help explains arguments. Up/Down recalls history; Tab completes commands and paths.

Ctrl+A/C/X/V/Z/Y and the editing icons act on the active field; output can be selected and remains read-only. Ctrl+C copies the selection or interrupts the command if nothing is selected; closing the terminal also interrupts the work.

Examples: cd /Documents; ls -l; cat "notes.md"; cp "notes.md" "copy.md". Loops: for f in *.md; do wc "$f"; done. Variables, quotes, > and >> redirection, && and || conditions are available.

Pipes: command | filter. Substitutions: $(command) or `command`. Without a file, cat/head/tail/grep/wc read from the pipe; < reads a file.

Limits: 16 commands per pipeline, 256 KiB between commands; substitutions: 4 levels and 8 KiB. Pipeline commands run sequentially; the status is that of the last command.

Double quotes preserve spaces in substitutions; single quotes disable substitutions. Background jobs with & are unavailable.

The dns, ping, tcp, ports, headers, wget and curl commands inspect the network and download to SD or USB; help followed by the command name explains parameters and gives an example. The separate Pentest app offers DNS, ICMP, TCP and HTTP/TLS analysis with a report you can save.

Configure the serial port. USB-C uses the USB Serial/JTAG device; RS485 uses the built-in connector. send adds the selected line ending; write preserves bytes and accepts a pipe or file as input. read receives bytes; listen receives for 60 seconds by default. Ctrl+C interrupts. clear empties the queues. Settings are saved; baud rate and format apply only to RS485.␀␀Le thÃ¨me sera disponible dans RÃ©glages aprÃ¨s redÃ©marrage.␀␀␀The theme is available immediately in Settings.␀Le transfert vers la carte et le lancement du programme sont des opÃ©rations distinctes.␀␀␀␀Transfer to the board and program execution are separate operations.␀␀␀␀Lecteur␀Reader␀␀Lecture␀Play␀␀␀␀Lecture EPUB incomplÃ¨te␀␀␀␀Incomplete EPUB read␀␀␀␀Could not read JPEG.␀␀␀␀Cannot read PNG.␀␀␀␀Lecture SD incomplÃ¨te ; projets conservÃ©s␀Incomplete SD read; projects preserved␀␀Lecture SD interrompue - actualisez␀SD reading interrupted - refresh the list␀␀␀Lecture SD interrompue - actualisez les applications␀␀␀␀SD read interrupted - refresh applications␀␀Lecture SD interrompue : vÃ©rifier la file de lâ€™imprimante␀␀␀␀SD read interrupted: check the printer queue␀␀␀␀Lecture SFTP interrompue.␀␀␀SFTP read interrupted.␀␀Lecture SSH interrompue.␀␀␀␀SSH read interrupted.␀␀␀Lecture USB interrompue␀USB reading interrupted␀Lecture WebP impossible␀Unable to read WebP␀Lecture ZIP compressÃ©e incomplÃ¨te␀Incomplete compressed ZIP read␀␀Lecture chapitre impossible␀Unable to read chapter␀␀Cannot read application␀Unable to read the font␀Lecture de la radio impossible␀␀Unable to read from the radio␀␀␀Lecture de lâ€™historique Meshtastic impossible␀Unable to read Meshtastic history␀␀␀Loading credentials...␀␀Lecture des nÅ“uds Meshtasticâ€¦␀␀␀␀Reading Meshtastic nodes...␀Lecture des titres en coursâ€¦␀␀Reading headings...␀Lecture des titresâ€¦␀␀␀Lecture du courrier impossible␀␀Cannot read mail␀␀␀␀Lecture du document impossible␀␀Cannot read file␀␀␀␀Lecture du fichier interrompue␀␀File read interrupted␀␀␀Lecture du servi