e sera conservÃ©e.␀␀Changes to reference files will be replaced. Their backup will be kept.␀Les mots de passe diffÃ¨rent␀␀␀␀Passwords do not match␀␀Les mots de passe ne sont pas envoyÃ©s dans une adresse web␀Passwords are not sent in a web address␀Les polices choisies sâ€™appliquent au prochain dÃ©marrage.␀The selected fonts take effect at the next startup.␀Les services de premier plan sont en pause. Les tÃ¢ches de fond restent actives.␀␀␀␀Foreground services are paused. Background tasks remain active.␀Les sources .py et dÃ©pendances mip seront copiÃ©es dans le catalogue SD, sans installation globale ni exÃ©cution.␀␀The .py sources and mip dependencies will be copied to the SD catalogue, without global installation or execution.␀␀Les sources seront installÃ©es avec leurs dÃ©pendances.␀Source files will be installed with their dependencies.␀Les stations sont fusionnÃ©es par adresse. Le catalogue prÃ©cÃ©dent est sauvegardÃ© dans radios.json.bak.␀␀␀Stations are merged by address. The previous catalog is backed up as radios.json.bak.␀␀␀Les Ã©ditions des archives se gÃ¨rent dans les options WikipÃ©dia.␀␀Manage archive editions in Wikipedia options.␀␀␀LibellÃ©s␀␀␀Labels␀␀Libre␀␀␀Custom␀␀Libres : %.1f Mio Â· mÃ©moire externe␀␀␀Free: %.1f MiB - external memory␀␀␀␀Libres : %u Kio Â· hors cache et rÃ©servations␀␀Free: %u KiB - excluding cache and reservations␀Libres : %u Kio Â· plus grand bloc : %u Kio␀Free: %u KiB - largest block: %u KiB␀␀␀␀LibÃ©ration des caches pour lâ€™impressionâ€¦␀␀␀Releasing caches for printing...␀␀␀␀LibÃ©ration des ressources encore en cours␀␀Resources are still being released␀␀Lien externe : ouverture web non disponible␀External link: web browsing is unavailable␀␀Lieu ␀␀␀Place ␀␀Lieu enregistrÃ©␀␀␀␀Place saved␀Lieu renommÃ©␀␀␀Place renamed␀␀␀Lieu supprimÃ©␀␀Place deleted␀␀␀Lieu sÃ©lectionnÃ©␀␀Selected place␀␀Lieux enregistrÃ©s␀␀Saved places␀␀␀␀Ligne IRC trop longue ignorÃ©e␀␀Oversized IRC line ignored␀␀Limite : 160 fichiers et 8 Mio par bibliothÃ¨que␀␀␀␀Limit: 160 files and 8 MiB per library␀␀Limite : 64 bibliothÃ¨ques par projet␀␀␀Limit: 64 libraries per project␀Limite de 64 secrets atteinte␀␀␀Limit of 64 secrets reached␀Limite de 8 certificats atteinte␀␀␀␀Limit of 8 certificates reached␀Limit of 8 keys reached␀Limit of 8 keys reached - legacy vault preserved␀␀␀␀Layer/memory limit reached.␀Limite de la source␀Source limit␀␀␀␀Layer stack limit reached.␀␀Limite des personnalisations atteinte - rÃ©initialisez l'accueil␀␀␀␀Customization limit reached - reset the home layout␀Limites : 16 commandes par tube, 256 Kio entre commandes ; substitutions : 4 niveaux et 8 Kio. Les commandes du tube sont exÃ©cutÃ©es successivement ; le statut est celui de la derniÃ¨re.␀Limits: 16 commands per pipeline, 256 KiB between commands; substitutions: 4 levels and 8 KiB. Pipeline commands run sequentially; the status is that of the last command.␀␀Limites de tuile invalides␀␀Invalid tile bounds␀Lire␀␀␀␀Read␀␀␀␀Lire / lancer␀␀␀Play / launch␀␀␀Lire en ligne␀␀␀Read online␀Lire hors ligne␀Read offline␀␀␀␀Liste␀␀␀Liste / plan␀␀␀␀List / outline␀␀Liste SSH pleine : retirez un hÃ´te avec ssh forget.␀␀␀␀SSH host list full: remove a host with ssh forget.␀␀Liste de nÅ“uds limitÃ©e Ã  32␀␀Node list limited to 32␀Liste des documents illisible␀␀␀Document list cannot be read␀␀␀␀Liste des documents invalide␀␀␀␀Invalid document list␀␀␀Liste des documents non enregistrÃ©e : vÃ©rifiez la carte SD␀␀␀␀Document list was not saved: check the SD card␀␀Liste le dossier courant ou indiquÃ©. -a inclut les fichiers cachÃ©s ; -l affiche le type et la taille.␀Lists the current or specified folder. -a includes hidden files; -l shows type and size.␀␀␀␀Liste les commandes ; ajoutez un nom pour ses paramÃ¨tres et un exemple.␀␀␀␀Lists commands; add a name to see its parameters and an example.␀␀␀␀Liste limitÃ©e Ã  256 documents␀List limited to 256 documents␀␀␀Liste limitÃ©e Ã  256 exclusions␀␀␀␀List limited to 256 exclusions␀␀Liste limitÃ©e Ã  8 projets␀List limited to 8 projects␀␀Liste pleine : 256 documents au maximum␀List full: maximum 256 documents␀␀␀␀Liste pleine : supprimez des dÃ©tections␀␀␀␀List full: delete some detections␀␀␀Liste tous les chemins du dossier et de ses sous-dossiers, jusqu'Ã  16 niveaux.␀Lists all paths in a folder and its subfolders, up to 16 levels.␀␀␀␀Liste uniquement les noms des variables. Pour lire volontairement une valeur, utilisez echo "$NOM".␀Lists variable names only. To intentionally read a value, use echo "$NOM".␀␀Livre␀␀␀Book␀␀␀␀Livre EPUB␀␀EPUB book␀␀␀Livre EPUB â€” ouvrez-le pour commencer la lecture.␀EPUB book - open it to start reading.␀␀␀Brightness␀␀Home keeps built-in tools; the ELF and Python icons each open a dedicated application menu. Applications in each menu are sorted by name. Built-in tools remain available without an SD card. F5 refreshes the catalogue; this is not an online store.

Settings -> Interface -> Display -> Home and sidebar opens sidebar and home customization; without the sidebar, Home remains at the top, and Alt+7 always opens Settings. Customize home sets applications, order, icons, grid or list, size and labels: Save keeps your choices, Back discards them, and Reset followed by Save restores the initial layout without deleting files.

Exiting a Python application closes its screen and returns to the previous OS screen. For applications offering Hide, that command keeps execution running. The sidebar resume button or Ctrl+Alt+P restores a hidden application while it remains active. Stop or Ctrl+. requests it to stop. When another application needs to stop before launching, confirm the proposed switch.

Maps -> Download opens the area form with the current centre, zoom and map background. Choose a city or coordinates, radius and zooms, then check the estimate. OpenTopoMap downloads directly on the tablet; pause/resume keeps progress. OpenStreetMap requires a source that allows these downloads or preparation on a PC. Return to Maps to view the result without restarting.

Wikipedia presents local and online results in the same pagination, without isolating a local result on its own page. An existing local copy takes priority. After reading online, Save this page makes it available offline. Options groups automatic saving, updates and complete downloads with language selection. A new complete archive requires confirmation before downloading. The reader keeps portrait orientation, text size and line spacing.

IRC Chat remembers nickname and server. Channels lets you join, leave, add or remove favourites and find recent channels. Hide keeps the connection. No message history is stored on the SD card; preferences remain in /System/irc.json.

Import radios uses Radio Browser. Wi-Fi and a correct date are required for secure connections.

In the Wikipedia reader, text links open other articles, searching local copies first. Backspace or Escape returns to results; Alt+Left also goes back. Illustrations in the reading toolbar shows or hides images. A local result's menu lets you delete the displayed copy or archive after confirmation. Tables keep their cells and horizontal scrolling.␀This branch tracks a local branch. Choose a remote repository.␀␀Lâ€™application choisie reÃ§oit le chemin du fichier. Elle doit prendre en charge son contenu.␀␀The selected application receives the file path. It must support the file contents.␀Lâ€™archive tÃ©lÃ©chargÃ©e sera remplacÃ©e. Vos articles enregistrÃ©s seront conservÃ©s.␀␀␀␀The downloaded archive will be replaced. Your saved articles will be kept.␀␀The Writing editor also opens Python files and other source files. Code stays unchanged, with visual highlighting. The Code menu groups Run, Stop, Resume, Libraries and Console. Run saves the .py file first; if saving fails, it does not start. The console can occupy the right pane.

Ctrl+Enter: save and run Python. Ctrl+.: stop. Ctrl+Shift+R: resume. Ctrl+Shift+L: show or hide the console. The editor's usual shortcuts remain available.

Documents keeps a list of files, even after they are unloaded from memory. The cross removes a listing, never the SD file. Ctrl+Shift+O opens this list; Ctrl+Tab / Ctrl+Shift+Tab switches to the next / previous document. Changing documents saves modifications; an error keeps the current document open.

Create a project with this document then groups other files. Add document to project adds to the selected group. Import a folder scans it progressively and detects new files while the editor is visible. Outside project keeps independent files. A file removed with the cross is not added again automatically.

Libraries opens the MicroPython catalogue, with target-board selection and modules added to the corresponding project. Libraries intended for another board stay separate from the Tab5 libraries; their drivers are not run on the Tab5. Declared compatibility does not guarantee operation on a specific board. CPython packages and native extensions are incompatible. Automatic uploading or flashing of another board is not provided.

Bundled scripts remain in /MicroPython. Check SD card compares resources before repair, preserves personal files and backs up each replaced file.

A compatible .elf file launches an application without replacing the OS. Its launch settings can be saved: ask for a file, run without a file, or always use the same file. Paths use sd:/Folder/file.ext for microSD and usb:/Folder/file.ext for the USB drive. They are not terminal commands. Stopping is cooperative. These applications can access OS memory: use trusted binaries built with the supplied SDK. A .bin file remains a firmware update.␀␀␀␀Lâ€™Ã©diteur Ã‰criture ouvre aussi les fichiers Python et les autres sources. Le code reste brut, avec une coloration visuelle. Le menu Code rassemble ExÃ©cuter, ArrÃªter, Reprendre, BibliothÃ¨ques et Console. ExÃ©cuter enregistre dâ€™abord le fichier .py ; si la sauvegarde Ã©choue, il ne dÃ©marre pas. La console peut prendre le panneau droit.

Ctrl+EntrÃ©e : enregistrer puis exÃ©cuter Python. Ctrl+. : arrÃªter. Ctrl+Maj+R : reprendre. Ctrl+Maj+L : afficher ou masquer la console. Les raccourcis habituels de lâ€™Ã©diteur restent disponibles.

Documents conserve une liste des fichiers, mÃªme dÃ©chargÃ©s de la mÃ©moire. La croix retire une inscription, jamais le fichier SD. Ctrl+Maj+O ouvre cette liste ; Ctrl+Tab / Ctrl+Maj+Tab passe au document suivant / prÃ©cÃ©dent. Un changement de document enregistre les modifications ; une erreur conserve le document courant.

CrÃ©er un projet avec ce document regroupe ensuite dâ€™autres fichiers. Ajouter le document au projet complÃ¨te le groupe choisi. Importer un dossier le parcourt progressivement et dÃ©tecte les nouveaux fichiers pendant que lâ€™Ã©diteur est visible. Hors projet garde les fichiers indÃ©pendants. Un fichier retirÃ© par la croix nâ€™est pas rÃ©introduit automatiquement.

BibliothÃ¨ques ouvre le catalogue MicroPython, avec choix de la carte cible et ajout des modules au projet correspondant. Les bibliothÃ¨ques destinÃ©es Ã  une autre carte restent sÃ©parÃ©es de celles du Tab5 ; leurs pilotes ne sont pas exÃ©cutÃ©s sur le Tab5. La compatibilitÃ© dÃ©clarÃ©e ne garantit pas le fonctionnement sur une carte prÃ©cise. Les paquets CPython et leurs extensions natives ne sont pas compatibles. Aucun tÃ©lÃ©versement ou flash automatique d'une autre carte n'est fourni.

Les scripts fournis restent dans /MicroPython. VÃ©rifier la carte SD compare les ressources avant rÃ©paration, conserve les fichiers personnels et sauvegarde chaque fichier remplacÃ©.

Un fichier .elf compatible ouvre Application : ExÃ©cuter le lance depuis la SD sans remplacer lâ€™OS. Lâ€™arrÃªt est coopÃ©ratif. Ces applications ont accÃ¨s Ã  la mÃ©moire de lâ€™OS : utilisez des binaires de confiance construits avec le SDK fourni. Un .bin reste une mise Ã  jour du firmware.␀␀␀The Writing editor opens Python files and other source code, preserving raw text and displaying syntax colors. The Code menu provides Run, Stop, Resume, Libraries and the console on the right. Ctrl+Enter saves and runs the Python file. Ctrl+. stops it.

The Documents menu keeps your open-file list even when buffers are released. The cross removes an entry without deleting its file. Switching first saves changes; a failed save keeps the current document.

Create a project from a document, add more files or import a folder. Imported folders are scanned progressively while the editor is visible. New files appear automatically; explicitly removed entries stay excluded. Standalone files remain available outside projects.

Libraries opens the MicroPython catalogue, with target-board selection and modules added to the corresponding project. Libraries for another board stay separate from the Tab5 modules; their hardware drivers are not executed on the Tab5. Declared compatibility does not guarantee operation on a particular board. CPython packages and native CPython extensions are incompatible. Automatic upload or flashing of another board is not provided.

Bundled scripts remain in /MicroPython. Check SD card compares resources before repair, preserves personal files and backs up each replaced file.

