Enregistrez les documents et arrÃªtez les applications ou transferts utilisant le support avant Ã‰jecter microSD ou Ã‰jecter USB. Une opÃ©ration en cours peut empÃªcher l'Ã©jection. Attendez sa confirmation avant de retirer la carte ou de dÃ©brancher le support. Un seul stockage USB peut Ãªtre montÃ© Ã  la fois, avec un clavier et une souris sur le hub. FAT16/FAT32 sont pris en charge.

Ressources manquantes recrÃ©e progressivement les fichiers systÃ¨me prÃ©vus qui sont absents, depuis le firmware. Annuler la rÃ©paration interrompt ce travail. Les fichiers existants, documents et personnalisations sont conservÃ©s. Cette fonction ne remplace pas les fichiers endommagÃ©s dÃ©jÃ  prÃ©sents et ne rÃ©cupÃ¨re pas les fichiers supprimÃ©s. Les polices, encyclopÃ©dies et applications .app.elf restent Ã  fournir sÃ©parÃ©ment.

Sans police SD exploitable, l'interface utilise temporairement l'anglais et la police intÃ©grÃ©e, sans changer la langue enregistrÃ©e ni les textes de vos documents. RedÃ©marrer avec la police rÃ©tablit la langue choisie. Aucun formatage ni rÃ©cupÃ©ration de donnÃ©es effacÃ©es n'est proposÃ© dans cette version.␀␀Settings -> Storage opens the microSD and USB controls, even without an SD card. Mount / retest microSD restarts detection; Open microSD goes to the root /. A compatible USB drive or card reader can mount automatically; this option can be disabled. USB files appear under /USB. Copy, paste, create, rename and delete work on both drives.

Save documents and stop applications or transfers using the drive before Eject microSD or Eject USB. An operation in progress may prevent ejection. Wait for confirmation before removing the card or unplugging the drive. One USB drive can be mounted at a time, alongside a keyboard and mouse on the hub. FAT16/FAT32 are supported.

Missing resources progressively recreates missing standard system files from the firmware. Cancel repair interrupts this work. Existing files, documents and customisations are preserved. This function does not replace damaged files already present and does not recover deleted files. Fonts, encyclopaedias and .app.elf applications must still be supplied separately.

Without a usable SD font, the interface temporarily uses English and the built-in font, without changing the saved language or your document text. Restarting with the font restores the selected language. This version offers neither formatting nor recovery of erased data.␀␀␀Settings -> Storage opens the microSD and USB controls, even without an SD card. Reconnect microSD restarts detection; Open in the microSD panel goes to the root /. A compatible USB drive or card reader can mount automatically; this option can be disabled. USB files appear under /USB. Copy, paste, create, rename and delete work on both drives.

Save documents and stop applications or transfers using the drive before choosing Eject in the drive's panel. An operation in progress may prevent ejection. Wait for confirmation before removing the card or unplugging the drive. One USB drive can be mounted at a time, alongside a keyboard and mouse on the hub. FAT16/FAT32 are supported.

Restore missing files progressively recreates missing standard system files from the firmware. Cancel interrupts this work. Existing files, documents and customisations are preserved. This function does not replace damaged files already present and does not recover deleted files. Fonts, encyclopaedias and .app.elf applications must still be supplied separately.

Without a usable SD font, the interface temporarily uses English and the built-in font, without changing the saved language or your document text. Restarting with the font restores the selected language. This version offers neither formatting nor recovery of erased data.␀RÃ©glages â†’ SystÃ¨me â†’ Carte SD par Wi-Fi ouvre un partage temporaire en lecture et Ã©criture. RÃ©seau actuel utilise votre Wi-Fi existant : le PC doit Ãªtre sur le mÃªme rÃ©seau. RÃ©seau direct crÃ©e un Wi-Fi temporaire ; dÃ©sactivez dâ€™abord le Wi-Fi de lâ€™OS, puis connectez le PC avec le nom et le mot de passe affichÃ©s.

Ouvrez lâ€™adresse affichÃ©e dans le navigateur du PC et saisissez le code. Aucun logiciel supplÃ©mentaire nâ€™est nÃ©cessaire. Le navigateur permet de consulter, tÃ©lÃ©charger, envoyer, renommer et supprimer des fichiers, et de crÃ©er des dossiers. Le partage sâ€™arrÃªte aprÃ¨s 30 minutes ou avec ArrÃªter.

Pendant un transfert, conservez la carte en place et Ã©vitez de modifier le mÃªme fichier dans une application. ArrÃªtez le partage avant de changer le Wi-Fi. Il sâ€™agit dâ€™un accÃ¨s navigateur ; la carte nâ€™apparaÃ®t pas comme une lettre de lecteur USB dans Windows.␀␀␀Settings -> System -> SD card over Wi-Fi opens temporary read/write sharing. Current network uses your existing Wi-Fi: the PC must be on the same network. Direct network creates temporary Wi-Fi; first turn off the OS Wi-Fi, then connect the PC using the displayed name and password.

Open the displayed address in the PC browser and enter the code. No additional software is needed. The browser lets you browse, download, upload, rename and delete files, and create folders. Sharing stops after 30 minutes or with Stop.

Keep the card inserted during a transfer and avoid editing the same file in an application. Stop sharing before changing Wi-Fi. This is browser access; the card does not appear as a USB drive letter in Windows.␀Settings -> System -> Sharing opens a temporary read/write share. Current network uses your existing Wi-Fi: the PC must be on the same network. Direct network creates a temporary Wi-Fi network; first disable the OS Wi-Fi, then connect the PC using the displayed name and password.

Open the displayed address in the PC browser and enter the code. No extra software is needed. The browser lets you browse, download, upload, rename and delete files, and create folders. Sharing stops after 30 minutes or with Stop.

During a transfer, leave the card in place and avoid editing the same file in an application. Stop sharing before changing Wi-Fi. This is browser access; the card does not appear as a USB drive letter in Windows.␀␀Settings, languages and keyboards␀␀␀RÃ©gler date et heure␀␀␀Set date and time␀␀␀RÃ©gler la date et lâ€™heure pour vÃ©rifier les certificats␀Set the date and time to verify certificates␀␀␀␀Set the date before making a secure connection.␀RÃ©glez la date et l'heure avant d'utiliser HTTPS.␀␀Set the date and time before using HTTPS.␀␀␀Set the date and time before enabling the alarm␀RÃ©importez lâ€™image externe avant de changer de dossier␀␀␀Reimport the external image before changing folders␀Vault reset must be completed␀␀␀RÃ©initialiser␀␀RÃ©initialiser le coffre␀␀␀␀Reset vault␀RÃ©initialiser le coffre local␀␀Reset local vault␀␀␀RÃ©paration des ressources annulÃ©e␀System resource repair cancelled␀␀␀␀RÃ©parer et mettre Ã  jour␀␀Repair and update␀␀␀RÃ©pertoire T5MAP invalide␀␀Invalid T5MAP directory␀RÃ©ponse SFTP invalide.␀Invalid SFTP response.␀␀RÃ©ponse WikipÃ©dia invalide␀␀␀␀Invalid Wikipedia response␀␀RÃ©ponse absente ou incomplÃ¨te␀Missing or incomplete response␀␀RÃ©ponse de lâ€™imprimante absente ou interrompue␀␀␀Printer response missing or interrupted␀RÃ©ponse de lâ€™imprimante invalide␀Invalid printer response␀␀␀␀RÃ©ponse de recherche invalide␀␀Invalid search response␀RÃ©ponse de tÃ©lÃ©chargement invalide␀␀␀Invalid download response␀␀␀RÃ©ponse du miroir invalide. RÃ©essayez avec un autre miroir.␀␀␀Invalid mirror response. Try another mirror.␀␀␀␀RÃ©ponse tardive aprÃ¨s envoi â€” vÃ©rifier la file de lâ€™imprimante␀␀␀Late response after sending - check the printer queue␀␀␀RÃ©ponses : ␀␀␀␀Replies: ␀␀␀RÃ©pÃ¨te les commandes pour chaque valeur. Maximum : 4 niveaux de scripts ou boucles et 10000 commandes par lancement.␀␀Repeats commands for each value. Maximum: 4 nested scripts or loops and 10000 commands per invocation.␀␀Network␀RÃ©seau : %s Â· mot de passe :