The heap is memory available for allocation. Firmware is stored in flash.␀␀␀SRAM HP Â· tas␀␀HP SRAM - heap␀␀SRAM fragmentÃ©e : bloc Bluetooth indisponible␀␀Fragmented SRAM: Bluetooth block unavailable␀␀␀␀SRAM insuffisante pour Bluetooth␀␀␀␀Not enough SRAM for Bluetooth␀␀␀SRAM interne␀␀␀␀Internal SRAM␀␀␀START␀␀␀Saisir RESET pour confirmer␀Type RESET to confirm␀␀␀Enter the vault PIN␀Saisir le mot de passe du fichier␀␀␀Enter the file password␀Saisir le texte␀Enter text␀␀Saisir un nom de paquet␀Enter a package name␀␀␀␀Saisir une recherche WikipÃ©dia␀Enter a Wikipedia search␀␀␀␀Saisir une ville␀␀␀␀Enter a city␀␀␀␀Saisissez au moins deux caractÃ¨res␀Enter at least two characters␀␀␀Enter the frequency in kHz or MHz; the touch keypad accepts a decimal point. Ranges are suggestions and can be changed: the dongle determines accepted frequencies and inputs. AM, WFM and NFM are modes, not frequency limits.

Apply changes settings during reception; the -/+ buttons use the selected step. The spectrum has separate controls for X span and offset, Y minimum and maximum. dBFS levels are relative, without power calibration.

In Scan, set the range, step, dwell and threshold, then Scan. Pause/Resume stops or continues the scan; Hold keeps the frequency for listening. Detections holds up to 2048 entries in pages of 24. Listen tunes to a frequency; Delete/Clear changes the list, then Save stores it in /System/SDR/detections.csv. The threshold does not identify the station.

In WFM, mono audio filters out stereo and RDS components. De-emphasis is generally 50 s in Europe or 75 s depending on the country. Correction (ppm) compensates for the dongle's oscillator error; start at 0 and adjust using a known frequency. A suitable antenna and sufficient radio signal are still needed.␀␀␀␀Saisissez la frÃ©quence en kHz ou MHz ; le clavier tactile accepte le point dÃ©cimal. Les plages sont indicatives et modifiables : la clÃ© dÃ©cide des frÃ©quences et entrÃ©es acceptÃ©es. AM, WFM et NFM sont des modes, pas des limites de frÃ©quence.

Appliquer change les rÃ©glages pendant la rÃ©ception ; les touches âˆ’/+ utilisent le pas choisi. Le spectre rÃ¨gle sÃ©parÃ©ment largeur et dÃ©calage X, minimum et maximum Y. Les niveaux dBFS sont relatifs, sans calibration de puissance.

