and transparency. BMP exports a flattened image on white. Dimensions: 1 to 1024 pixels per side.␀␀␀T5I preserves layers. BMP and JPEG export the flattened image on white.␀TLS : certificat et nom d'hÃ´te vÃ©rifiÃ©s.␀TLS: certificate and hostname verified.␀TXT / Markdown, clavier, Undo/Redo␀␀TXT / Markdown, keyboard, Undo/Redo␀Tab / Shift+Tab: next / previous control. Arrow keys choose a control in that direction. Enter activates the selection or starts editing. Escape leaves editing; press it again to reach the sidebar.

Command/Windows alone, Cmd+/ or F6: switch between sidebar and app, restoring the previous selection. Right from the sidebar returns to the app. Alt+1 to Alt+7: Home, Explorer, Editor, eBook, Media, Maps, Settings.

Lists separate selection from action: Up/Down select a row; Enter opens it. Dialogs keep navigation inside the dialog. F1 opens or closes help; Escape also closes it.␀␀␀Tab5 shell
