Ctrl+A sÃ©lectionne tout le document. Page prÃ©cÃ©dente / suivante change de passage ; Ctrl+DÃ©but / Fin atteint les extrÃ©mitÃ©s du document. Ctrl+Maj+DÃ©but / Fin Ã©tend la sÃ©lection. Inser bascule le remplacement. Ã‰chap quitte la saisie ; choisissez la zone de texte puis EntrÃ©e pour reprendre.␀␀Touch the text to place the caret. Hold then drag to select characters; holding without dragging selects a word. A normal swipe scrolls. On a keyboard, Shift+arrows extends the selection.

Bold and Italic stay active while typing. With a selection, they change that selection; switching a style off removes it. Heading changes the current paragraph. Text and highlight colours are set in the palette.

Ctrl+S: save. Ctrl+Shift+S: save as. Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O: new / open. Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y: undo / redo. Ctrl+B / Ctrl+I: bold / italic. Ctrl+C / X / V: copy / cut / paste. Ctrl+F / Ctrl+H: find / replace.

Ctrl+A selects the whole document. Ctrl+Shift+Home/End extends the selection; Insert toggles overwrite mode. Page Up / Page Down changes passage; Ctrl+Home / End reaches the document ends. Escape leaves editing; select the text area then Enter to resume.␀␀Touch the text to place the caret. Hold then drag to select characters; holding without dragging selects a word. A normal swipe scrolls. On a keyboard, Shift+arrows extends the selection.

