Ctrl+A selects the whole document. Ctrl+Shift+Home/End extends the selection; Insert toggles overwrite mode. Page Up / Page Down changes passage; Ctrl+Home / End reaches the document ends. Escape leaves editing; select the text area then Enter to resume.

Display -> Serial opens communication on the port chosen in Settings. In Data mode, Send transmits the selection, or the whole document if nothing is selected. Listen receives text in a separate panel; Insert places it in the document. Collapsing the panel keeps listening active; leaving the editor stops its serial session. For binary files and stream redirection, use the terminal serial commands.␀␀␀␀Touchez le texte pour placer le curseur. Maintenez puis glissez pour sÃ©lectionner des caractÃ¨res ; un maintien sans glissement sÃ©lectionne un mot. Un glissement ordinaire fait dÃ©filer. Au clavier, Maj+flÃ¨ches Ã©tend la sÃ©lection.

